	(text "2 universal inputs (4-20 mA, thermocouple, 2/3-wire Pt100/Pt1000). Terminals per channel: A, B, C. C1 and C2 are one net. DIP switches 1+2 (AI1) and 3+4 (AI2) ON = 4-20 mA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "00734512-4677-54a8-b777-68db914d9e33")
	)
	(text "2.5 V reference and DAC"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 292.1 134.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1f4bedc0-4097-5a28-9f46-8fe51ae1a1df")
	)
	(text "ADC. AVDD = 5 V for IDAC headroom; logic at 3.3 V. AIN1/AIN3 (B sense) can take VBIAS for thermocouples. Firmware: REFP buffer on, PGA bypassed for 4-20 mA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3ea98e47-102a-5118-a75b-3fc690378ef7")
	)
	(text "4-20 mA output: Iout = 10 x Vin / 1k, so 2.0 V = 20 mA. OD is high (output off) while the watchdog has no heartbeat. Terminals: AO, M."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 200.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "67c136a6-df01-5725-8344-6000068ba5bf")
	)
	(text "4-20 mA: + to A, - to B (B is grounded by the switch). TC: + to A, - to B. RTD 3-wire: single lead to A, the pair to B and C. RTD 2-wire: A and B, bridge B-C."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "841373d0-8755-580d-a751-91fbf4bea84b")
	)
	(text "L+ monitor: 2.5 V full scale = 33 V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 241.3 129.54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9773da9e-8e17-5022-a8bc-7765db295e29")
	)
	(text "Cold junction: NTC at the AI terminals, ratiometric to REFOUT"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 195.58 134.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c5356a65-d935-5a21-ae1b-e5fab05fe461")
	)
	(text "RTD return and reference: both IDAC currents flow through RREF, so VREF = 2 x I x RREF (ratiometric). The 1k in C limits a 24 V miswire."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 254 68.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d43ff135-9a11-5fb7-b8db-98e39afb29b4")
	)
